# Copy to mobile/.env (gitignored). Read by scripts/mobile-run.sh and passed to
# Flutter as --dart-define. Flutter does NOT read this file at runtime — the
# values are compiled in, so a change here needs a fresh `flutter run`.
#
# Consumed by mobile/lib/config.dart. Leave a line out to keep its production
# default (https://api.voteaxis.org / https://voteaxis.org).
#
# Simple KEY=value only — this file is sourced by bash. No spaces around `=`.

# Voteaxis API (server/, `bun run api`, defaults to port 8787).
#   iOS Simulator:    http://127.0.0.1:8787
#   Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:8787   <- 127.0.0.1 is the emulator itself
#   Physical device:  http://<your-LAN-IP>:8787
# VOTEAXIS_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787

# Marketing site (web/, `bun run web`). Backs the in-app Support link.
# VOTEAXIS_SITE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
